@startuml eval_cycle
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFF4D6
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #444444
skinparam ArrowColor #333333

title Benchmark → Evaluate → Improve Cycle (Phase I, Oct–Dec)

start
repeat
  :Fix scenario set\nS1/S2/S3 synthetic (5/20/40 % obstacles)\n+ real-region lattice\n× wind cases (calm, 8 directions, gusts);
  fork
    :Tier 1 NAMOA*\n(exact front, label counts);
  fork again
    :A* distance / energy / risk\nweighted-sum A* per preset;
  fork again
    :MOPSO 100 particles × 200 iterations\n× 30 seeded repeats;
  end fork
  :Union reference front per scenario;
  :HV, IGD, spread Δ, runtime\n(mean ± std over repeats);
  :Tier 2 evidence: 4 presets, 225-tag sweep,\nalignment vs knee / crowding / fixed weights,\nmonotonicity check, latency;
  :Gazebo + SITL flights of the picks:\ncross-track error, clearance, landing offset;
  :Analyse weak spots\n(front collapse, truncation,\nweights, risk calibration, sim gaps);
  :Change model / parameters / simulator;
repeat while (results stable and better\nthan every baseline?) is (no)
->yes;
:Freeze numbers for the Phase I report;
stop
@enduml
